## Project Structure

```
Godot/
├── scripts/
│   ├── core/                    — CDEntity, CDGame, base classes, infrastructure
│   ├── entity components/
│   │   ├── brains/              — 17 intent generators
│   │   ├── legs/                — 15 movement executors
│   │   ├── arms/                — 16 world-interaction components
│   │   ├── guts/                — 19 internal state trackers
│   │   ├── faces/               — 7 visual representations
│   │   └── voices/              — 2 entity audio components
│   ├── game components/
│   │   ├── cards/               — 4 UI display components
│   │   ├── directors/           — 7 stage controllers
│   │   ├── goals/               — 2 win/lose conditions
│   │   ├── marks/               — 6 spatial triggers
│   │   ├── projectors/          — 2 visual post-processing
│   │   ├── speakers/            — 3 audio components
│   │   └── trapdoors/           — 3 spawners
│   └── effects/                 — 3 visual effects (2 self-destructing, 1 persistent)
├── scenes/                      — Scene assemblies (entity + game component instances)
├── entities/                    — Entity prefabs (generic, player, nonplayer)
├── games/                       — Game scene roots
├── shaders/                     — CRT + persistence shaders
├── assets/                      — Fonts, music, voice lines
└── v1/                          — Archived V1 architecture (itch.io demo)
```

---

## The Games

12 playable games — all assembled from the same component library, no game-specific scripts:

| Type | Games |
|------|-------|
| **Remakes** | Paddle Ball, Brick Breaker, Space Rocks, Bug Blaster, Block Drop |
| **Remixes** | Dogfight, Meteor Rally, Rock Breaker, Bug Drop, Space Bugs |
| **Inversions** | Planetary Attack!, Space Rocks Inverted |

---

## Tech Stack

- **Engine:** Godot 4.5 (GDScript)
- **Audio:** Procedural synthesis at runtime — all sound effects generated in real-time via `AudioStreamGenerator`
- **Visuals:** Custom CRT shader (barrel warp, chromatic aberration, bloom, vignette, hum bar) + vector monitor mode with phosphor persistence
- **Fonts:** [Kenney](https://kenney.nl) retro pixel fonts

